Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,上啊 开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get at him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要见血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Draw blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌尔比安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulpianus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌尔比安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulpianus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打啊 干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Get at him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.69,0:09:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 乌尔比安\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Ulpianus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种角斗真是不够看\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fight far from worthy arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但奖励还是会给\N{\fnArial\fs30}But promise was made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:09:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受你的荣誉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feast upon laurels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking shit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想拿剑 从背后攻击你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He reached for sword to strike when you presented back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是去拿吃的 你这个疯女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was reaching for the food, you mad cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 不然就拔掉你的舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold tongue, or see it ripped from fucking head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take pause, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃提斯是我们一边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attius stands with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.83,0:10:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他替该死的罗马人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stands a fucking Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.57,0:10:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人不管对奴隶还是对谁 从不耀武扬威\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man has never raised voice in anger, to slave, or any other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友们这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do your friends differ, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们眼里的那些渣滓有什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the fucking villain they brand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是去拿面包吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he reaching for the bread?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not think it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是你弄错了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if you were mistaken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.81,0:11:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}The result the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.16,0:11:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,决不允许罗马人威胁到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Roman that shall never raise hand against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对罗马人没有任何感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never held love for any of such name, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但他对我们没威胁 - 他那种人威胁最大\N{\fnArial\fs30}- yet he held no threat - Men such as him hold the greatest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,表面和善可亲 往往一肚子坏水\N{\fnArial\fs30}True intent, shrouded behind mask of kind and gentle face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you known his reflection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.49,0:11:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我去卢卡尼亚矿区之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I came to the mines of Lucania.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个名叫海瑞斯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one carried gentle name of Herius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有妻子 和两个小女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Husband. Father of two young daughters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我吃的 让我洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw me fed. Bathed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在离开巴蒂塔斯家后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allowed me to feel safe for the first time since being turned{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次感觉到安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the House of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:11:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他家人都睡了后 他来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When his family took to sleep, he came to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我抱起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lifting me in his arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚开始我还以为是在做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it a dream at first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.76,0:12:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a place, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,离他的宅子很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}removed from the grounds of his villa, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.04,0:12:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里是制作和修理马车的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where wagons were crafted and repaired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我身上用了很多工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}He applied his many tools inside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后到处都沾满了血肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before turning them to outward flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.59,0:12:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能抓住你的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had power to seize memory, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.89,0:12:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,将它彻底赶出你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with hands strip it from life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.41,0:12:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是最让我难过的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not the one that shadows mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在晨光中看到的情景\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I saw in morning light, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:13:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是一生难忘的阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever darkens thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man himself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,用亲吻和温暖的笑容\N{\fnArial\fs30}greeting his wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,问候妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}with kiss and warm smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的女儿在他膝上欢笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}His daughters laughing upon his knee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,前一晚那个嗜血的野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The beast from the previous night transformed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.11,0:13:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇身变成了最温柔的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a man who held no threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无话可说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not need them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用知道 你在我身边给了我安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing, you are at my side gives comfort enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都不离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will always stand so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的粮食都成这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the fucking stalls bear same misfortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of the remainder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 够我们吃多久 - 两周\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How long will it see us fed? - Two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许可以更久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps more, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们 省着用 而且人数不增加\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we're cautious and our numbers do not swell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真他妈见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.58,0:14:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,码头有船停靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ships weigh anchor off our coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有人注意到我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems we have drawn notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.62,0:14:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do your eyes fall upon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有四个人过来 全副武装\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four men approach. Armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.37,0:14:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人扛着一只桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}One with cask perched atop shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.14,0:14:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,外表看起来不大像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not fucking likely, by appearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What shit is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,西利西亚的强盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brigands of Cilicia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.63,0:14:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pirates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟这里管事的人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would speak with the man that has claimed this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.83,0:15:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在听你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your words fall upon his ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这儿有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}What business do you break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.81,0:15:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand so named.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你搞垮了卡普亚竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same fiend that brought down the arena in Capua?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.39,0:15:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在维苏威大败葛雷博\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defeated Glaber at Vesuvius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.84,0:15:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给共和国和罗马人造成了难以估量的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrought untold suffering upon the Republic and its people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}All deeds claimed with pride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.84,0:15:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就当你是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I call you fucking brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起畅饮美酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us share gift of wine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛骂我们共同的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and break words towards common enemy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖乌斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been too many years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,岁月不饶人啊 老友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have been unkind to you, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我不像一头毛茸茸的山羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I do not stand woolly fucking goat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏不让我刮脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus denies me sharpened blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.46,0:16:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under what purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}A personal matter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.92,0:16:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他信任的人才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}concerning only those within his confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜这儿没这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regrettably none stand so here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提前收到了我们到来的消息吗 莫姆缪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have received message in advance of our arrival, Mummius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备好了 等你下令就出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stand ready to march upon your command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.38,0:16:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此之前先用我的营帐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have use of my tent until such a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.13,0:16:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让小子们留在这里谋划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would leave these boys to their plotting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来给我说说安东尼乌斯的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hear of your adventures with Antonius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是放肆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impudent shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把你晾在一边 去舔恺撒的鸡巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brushes you aside in favor of swallowing Caesar's cock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿噎不死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us pray he chokes upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:16:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿德贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adherbal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.37,0:17:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把桶打开 我们畅饮美酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break open cask so we may share drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would break words in advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.82,0:17:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还没有搞清楚状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}While mind is yet unclouded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.81,0:17:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥是你的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heracleo is your guest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的仆从\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am at your will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的本事这么大 能偷一座城\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is an honor for me to be across from the man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,能见到你是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}who steals an entire fucking city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是该死的罗马人偷了我们的自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the fucking Romans who stole freedom from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是拿回我们应有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We merely seize what is owed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你们的说法 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I favor turn of your reason, brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,希留爱沙还有罗马人活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some Romans yet live within Sinuessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.99,0:17:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,市政官也活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aedile among them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.90,0:17:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确定吗 - 我们占了他的宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are sure of this? - His villa now stands ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我亲手解决了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}His claim to it severed by my own hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I too have been injured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.44,0:17:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人说话总他妈兜圈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man speaks in fucking riddles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.76,0:17:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有话直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straighten tongue, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}or fall from presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.85,0:17:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,市政官跟我有个协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aedile and I had an arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:17:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟你这种人做生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brokered such with men of your calling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是公开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Openly, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多事情都是暗地里进行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet many things are born of dark corners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大海充满了危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}The seas are fraught with dangers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是对那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially for those who, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他当成敌手的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}consider themselves his competitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.51,0:18:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回报你们的服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return for your "Services"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,透露那些可怜的船只何时起航 走哪条线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowledge of time and route of unfortunate vessels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上的货物 算到我的货物里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All goods aboard, added to my own, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.32,0:18:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,再在这份新的清单上\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the seal of the Aedile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.36,0:18:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,加盖市政官的公章\N{\fnArial\fs30}pressed upon new manifest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗贼为什么要跟协议和公章扯上关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What cause does thief upon wave need of parchment and seal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.31,0:18:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大港口交易来历不明的货物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The official seal removes unwanted attention when{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,公章可以减少不必要的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}trading acquisitions in respected ports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果你们这一动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advantage snatched from hand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.22,0:18:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的好处也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by fucking action of your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.53,0:18:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮笑肉不笑的操蛋家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}To shit with this grinning cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.35,0:18:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾力冈 - 他有什么能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agron. - What threat does he hold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海上朝我们撒尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pissing on us from the sea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.05,0:19:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等尿到你身上可别吓坏了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would be surprised by the reach of my stream, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's us take breath then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.23,0:19:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话都注意一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}remove ourselves from heated words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来喝酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is yet drink to be had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.39,0:19:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等月亮升起再过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return when sun gives way to moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候再看有没有举杯的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And discover if there stands cause to share cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听凭吩咐 斯巴达克斯大王\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you command, King Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.26,0:19:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,听凭吩咐\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人还真他妈的牛逼哄哄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man swings cock to rival Jupiter himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上城门 把他结果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close gate upon ass, and be done with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人也许还有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may yet be of use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到市政官的印章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Aedile's seal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看看有没有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let us weigh advantage it brings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,西利西亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cilicians!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,满嘴都是屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit rises to fill mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.94,0:19:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底见没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you laid eyes upon it or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只管打铁 不是码头的生意人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forge steel, not trade at fucking ports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.53,0:19:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要市政官的印章有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}What need would I have of Aedile's seal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,早说不就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words I would have greeted sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢得自由之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what it was like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:20:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you gained your freedom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生来就是像野兽一样打斗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you made to fight as an animal would, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.35,0:20:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像对待可怜的乌尔比安那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you made poor Ulpianus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是我要耍他 - 但你没有阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I prompted no contest. - Yet you did not stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你决定帮助我们夺城时\N{\fnArial\fs30}What fate did you believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为现在是什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}when deciding to aid in taking the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.51,0:20:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I held no fucking choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人在任何时候都有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every man holds such at time's end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢那些人 埃提斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hold no love for these people, Attius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就不要假装慈悲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not now raise vaunted concerns now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"These people."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.61,0:20:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是罗马人 我不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I not Roman, as they were?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.01,0:20:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和那些幸存者不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As some yet are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.15,0:20:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只代表自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand for yourself alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.85,0:20:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I once stood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经证明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are proof then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最低贱的泥土\N{\fnArial\fs30}That basest clay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,都可能塑造成价值连城的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}may yet be molded into something of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn from past, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.24,0:20:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,展望全新的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}set eye toward new horizon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,远走高飞 改头换面\N{\fnArial\fs30}far from this place and the man that you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞美诸神 终于找到能说上话的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praise fucking gods, I've found men of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.66,0:21:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是从什么地方来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What crude form do you deposit at feet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.15,0:21:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,希留爱沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sinuessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯占领了希留爱沙山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus has taken Sinuessa en Valle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.76,0:21:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,传莫姆缪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Summon Mummius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就给我们有价值的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repay favor with gift of words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么特别有价值的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have few of note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.91,0:21:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为城门关好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought the gate secure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可斯巴达克斯是从地狱来的魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet Spartacus is of the underworld, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.43,0:21:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能穿过木头和石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}able to spirit himself through wood and stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不过是个凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is but a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've laid eyes upon him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.58,0:21:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,浑身是血和伤 整座城都为之颤抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bathed in blood and gore. The city trembling in his wake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.28,0:21:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯不是凡人 他是死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus is no man. He's the Bringer of Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.73,0:21:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的战斗技能跟那个传奇人物不相上下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your skill in combat must equal that of the legend himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.26,0:22:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,市政官给了我一点钱帮着执行宵禁命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was paid but a few coin by the Aedile to aid in curfew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是士兵 - 别管这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm no soldier. - Put such question aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯手下有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many men does Spartacus now hold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.08,0:22:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.54,0:22:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的人挤满了街道 一路上见人就杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The streets were filled with them, slaughtering all in their path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.21,0:22:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赶在他们抢占码头之前逃了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely made escape to the bay before they took the docks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it becomes clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.59,0:22:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不愿意英勇战死 而选择逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}In place of falling a hero, you chose to flee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.09,0:22:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fall a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.91,0:22:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you lost mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.09,0:22:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人没有用处 他自己说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man held no worth, by his own tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不归你管事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not in fucking command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.41,0:22:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.19,0:22:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slip from reason…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到不争气的下属就控制不住脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}when presented with the faults of lesser men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.69,0:22:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先清理尸体 再商讨…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see body removed, and discuss{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.77,0:22:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用商讨什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time for words has ended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔营\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break camp, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.80,0:22:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去跟我父亲报告斯巴达克斯的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}and return to my father with news of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.19,0:22:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他命令我守在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave order to remain at your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.23,0:23:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代马科斯•克拉苏行使权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the word and the will of Marcus Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.20,0:23:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在我身边 盖乌斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not at my side, Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.38,0:23:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serve beneath me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那便遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fall to command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.22,0:23:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,召集你的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather what remains of your men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.41,0:23:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们向希留爱沙山进军\N{\fnArial\fs30}We move for Sinuessa en Valle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.53,0:23:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把宅子翻了两遍 还是一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have seached the villa twice upon, and with empty hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.80,0:23:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,漫无目的地找肯定不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seach horn give lack result.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.02,0:23:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去告诉赫拉克里奥 让他滚回海上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let send word to Heracleo, return to the fucking sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.11,0:23:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想操之过急\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not beat so quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.70,0:23:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事我同意艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with Agron in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.48,0:23:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢西利西亚人的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not care looking at Cilicians' eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.70,0:23:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有我们没有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he has what we do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.28,0:23:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,船只 可以运送粮食和补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ships. Ships can carry grain and supplies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.48,0:23:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算克拉苏对陆地进行了封锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when upon land blocked by Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:24:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要的东西找不到 我们如何交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do we strike bargain absent what he seeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.13,0:24:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳美特斯那边怎么样 你问过没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of Nemetes? Have you broken words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.62,0:24:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也没有看到印章\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not lay eyes upon the seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.52,0:24:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在大海捞针一样地找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare picking bones the city clean seach the very coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.38,0:24:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯属白费力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}We waste effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.31,0:24:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有人能发现秘密藏好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no one among us can divine words with secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.89,0:24:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我只能求人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I should entreat miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从贵族下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of lofty standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.80,0:24:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,都出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.97,0:24:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stood my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.66,0:24:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.15,0:24:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿意求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not beg for my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.60,0:24:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not seek it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.36,0:25:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only your aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.85,0:25:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我夫君\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rob me of my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.85,0:25:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟蹋我的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay waste to my city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.64,0:25:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在还想要我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you call upon fucking aid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.75,0:25:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在打仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are at war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.48,0:25:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有死有伤再正常不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your people stand casualty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.94,0:25:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人并不想留一个活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own ranks question sparing a few that yet draw breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.87,0:25:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我要证明留你们活命是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give chance to prove wisdom of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.46,0:25:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就该像你们的玩物一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we may live out our days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.99,0:25:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,取悦你们 供你们消遣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}as party favors for your fucking amusement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.07,0:25:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像乌尔比安一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As word carries of Ulpianus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.06,0:25:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌尔比安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulpianus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.17,0:25:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人让他为了一块面包去决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your men made him fight for crust of bread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.11,0:25:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他打赢了 还是砍了他一只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And claimed hand even though he stood victor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.56,0:25:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不知道这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing I did not know of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.46,0:25:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事不会再发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shall not pass again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.58,0:25:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经信任过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took belief in your reassurance once before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.64,0:25:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却杀了我的夫君\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now stand widow for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.17,0:25:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的事由我担当\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not turn from what I have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.05,0:25:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为人正直\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was an honorable man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.10,0:25:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,却让你给杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever stricken from this world by you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.20,0:25:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太抬举他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You elevate the dead beyond their worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.11,0:26:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not know him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.92,0:26:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor I fear did you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.93,0:26:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识赫拉克里奥这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name Heracleo holds meaning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.93,0:26:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这人是海上的恶霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}A plague upon the sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.59,0:26:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我夫君重金悬赏他的人头\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband devoted much coin toward his capture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.25,0:26:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夫君为了更大的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}He devoted greater sum, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.90,0:26:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,与他签订秘密协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards secret pact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.00,0:26:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.46,0:26:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你夫君以公章为条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband provided seal of office{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.19,0:26:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用他除去对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}in exchange for dispatching of his rivals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.56,0:26:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是赫拉克里奥亲手给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presented to me by Heracleo himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.43,0:26:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不想破坏你对他的美好印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know that I do not take pleasure in staining cherished memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.68,0:26:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁了我的整个世界 还要装好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tear world from grasp, and whisper of kindness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.48,0:26:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是给你一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I whisper of opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.65,0:26:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥需要市政官的印章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heracleo seeks the Aedile's seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.46,0:26:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了印章 我就可以交易来粮食\N{\fnArial\fs30}With it I will forge trade that will see us fed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.73,0:26:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找不到印章的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It eludes discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.28,0:26:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道印章在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know of the seal's location?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.88,0:27:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩尼乌斯害怕有人叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ennius feared rebellion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.51,0:27:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以把他的东西保管得很严\N{\fnArial\fs30}and took measure to protect what was his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.34,0:27:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这座城中有无数个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many places hidden to eye{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.85,0:27:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密贮藏点\N{\fnArial\fs30}among his holdings throughout the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.19,0:27:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aid in revealing them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.15,0:27:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从西利西亚人那里交易来的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you and your people will share equal portion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定也有你们的一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}from what we gain in bargain with the Cilician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.55,0:27:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要获得自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have freedom as price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.02,0:27:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.73,0:27:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到印章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do this thing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.03,0:27:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们离开希留爱沙山后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will be released, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.84,0:27:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we take leave of Sinuessa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.74,0:27:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么才能相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to trust your word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.24,0:27:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reason is simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.27,0:27:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没得选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand absent choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.40,0:27:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然藏在守护神的赤瞳里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hidden within blushed eye, the guardian spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.44,0:27:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪诸神要遗弃你的丈夫 和这座城市呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a wonder the gods turned on your husband and this fucking city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.93,0:28:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的不要再提 还是谈我们的生意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us turn from past and set gaze towards favored bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.23,0:28:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要痛快喝个够\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fall to much needed drink!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.51,0:28:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开价多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much would you have for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.96,0:28:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.23,0:28:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们离开这座城后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upon our abandoning the city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.14,0:28:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这印章就归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the seal is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.84,0:28:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此之前呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And until such fated day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.86,0:28:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,订一个贸易协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}An agreement of trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.75,0:28:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,以钱换粮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coin for food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.29,0:28:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你船上的头一批货给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}First shipment from what stores you have aboard your ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.26,0:28:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在要求波塞冬脱裤子露屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would entreat Poseidon to shun robes and present ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.17,0:28:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他在这里我就敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he stood before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.13,0:28:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜他不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he does not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.88,0:28:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的货品质上乘\N{\fnArial\fs30}My supplies are of finest quality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.12,0:28:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在港口很容易卖到一万八千第纳尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighteen thousand denarii easily fetched if sold at port.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.73,0:28:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有印章的话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent the Aedile's seal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.44,0:28:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这人真是不可理喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not the man one expects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.62,0:28:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一万第纳尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten thousand denarii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.71,0:29:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上市政官的老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Aedile's wife is added to the bargain huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mistake me for a Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.81,0:29:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不做奴隶贸易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not trade in slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.40,0:29:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的美人 换我也不卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor would I, if possessed with such a ripe cunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.09,0:29:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一万两千第纳尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelve thousand denarii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.62,0:29:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出前一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In hour before sun's rising, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.91,0:29:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,到城外的岸边交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon landing beyond city walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.35,0:29:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.32,0:29:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆地太不安全了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground absent advantage, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.43,0:29:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不愿意冒险把船开进港\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not sail into port, only to be set upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.81,0:29:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond city walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.48,0:29:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出前一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In hour before sun rises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.33,0:29:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is settled then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.68,0:29:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下总可以喝个痛快了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now may we have fucking drink?! Huh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.32,0:30:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥带来的什么狗屁酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What fucking piss does Heracleo offer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.17,0:30:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,苦艾酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absinthe, by name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.88,0:30:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有次一下子喝了六杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I once drained six cups, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.53,0:30:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后跟一只幻想中的猫吵得不可开交\N{\fnArial\fs30}and found myself in heated argument with imaginary cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.96,0:30:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就在你离开罗马海岸之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let us drain seven, and finish argument{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.76,0:30:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再喝个七杯 跟它吵完为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you strike from Roman shores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.01,0:30:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.37,0:30:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着别人的男人看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dangerous thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.63,0:30:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一件很危险的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes upon man not your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.79,0:30:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies. I meant no offense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.28,0:30:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想和他共享鱼水之欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want his cock inside you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.69,0:30:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说 你这小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak, little thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.96,0:31:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳美特斯人 你这孬种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemetes, you cock eater!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.71,0:31:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.70,0:31:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想谢谢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I desire only to thank him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.45,0:31:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.05,0:31:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好好聊两句
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.72,0:31:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不鸟这些西利西亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not care for these Cilicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.92,0:31:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可罗马人很喜欢他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet they are preferred to Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.68,0:31:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的鸡巴有魔力\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cock is magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.43,0:31:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我面前消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then see it vanish from sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.52,0:31:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}More wine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.05,0:31:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.68,0:31:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然相信一个言而无信之徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}To lay trust in one stitched of lies and deceit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.73,0:31:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是第一次跟这种人打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no stranger to his kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.20,0:31:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,原以为我也是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought myself so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.80,0:32:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我到现在还放不下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet now replay every moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.86,0:32:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我夫君生前对我的每一次爱抚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every touch my husband laid upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.89,0:32:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,背后却隐藏着残酷的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questioning truth behind them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.17,0:32:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是诸神对我愚蠢无知的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods punish me for being so blind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.84,0:32:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如让赫拉克里奥带走我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that you had let Heracleo take me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.35,0:32:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我承受诸神的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see their wrath complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.62,0:32:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信你的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I place no stock in your gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.59,0:32:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不要那些无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor any that would seek injury{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.31,0:32:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,经受什么诸神的惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}for crimes against those undeserving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.61,0:32:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have given command{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.90,0:32:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在城里自由活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you are free to move about city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.45,0:32:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.87,0:32:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will lend hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.50,0:32:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保那些罗马人填饱肚子\N{\fnArial\fs30}in seeing your people receive proper share of food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.99,0:32:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人遭受虐待 你就来通知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And carry word to me if any should fall to mistreatment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.50,0:32:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}It surprises, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.49,0:32:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小小的镣铐压得人喘不过气来\N{\fnArial\fs30}how such small a weight bears such heavy burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.80,0:33:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有反抗罗马的人都知道这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A truth known to all who take up arms against Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.28,0:33:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就睡在这里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall sleep where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.05,0:33:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们如果知道我睡在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people will turn from me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.41,0:33:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会背弃我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I'm known to bed beneath your roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.73,0:33:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我夫君在城边有一个马厩\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband held stable at edge of city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.97,0:33:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要住到那里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would take shelter within its walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.72,0:33:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想让你住得舒适些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sought only to provide comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.78,0:33:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫拉克里奥说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heracleo spoke the truth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.00,0:33:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少有一件事说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least upon one subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.01,0:33:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这人真是不可理喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not the man one expects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.29,0:34:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.48,0:34:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝了这杯 我就原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Share drink, and see them accepted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.29,0:34:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟别人喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cup is spoken for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.05,0:34:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的兴趣不在于你喝我的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek not to claim it my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.38,0:34:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在于双唇之间的甘露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merely grace lips with its nectar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.56,0:34:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话很放肆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are bold of words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.54,0:34:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在海上待太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been too long at sea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.24,0:34:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟粗人混在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}among, rough company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.62,0:34:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢大风大浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not favor crashing waves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.05,0:34:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words from mouth such as yours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.72,0:34:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就永不再回到海上\N{\fnArial\fs30}could move a man to forever turn from them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.42,0:34:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove fucking hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.73,0:34:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He meant no harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.52,0:34:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.14,0:34:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道一朵鲜花插在莱茵河东 一坨牛粪上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not know you were mired in shit east of the Rhine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.15,0:35:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,揍他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smash him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.13,0:35:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.47,0:35:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.28,0:35:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall from sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.03,0:35:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这欢宴有点不和谐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revelry has struck sour note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.20,0:35:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望无谓的争吵给我们之间造成裂隙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have senseless quarrel open gap between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.90,0:35:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就在我们交易之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then see it filled with coin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.46,0:35:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,带足银子\N{\fnArial\fs30}at appointed hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.56,0:35:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们这次合作牢不牢靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we shall test sureness of our footing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.75,0:36:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,宴会搞成这样 斯巴达克斯很不高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus stands displeased with celebration's end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.23,0:36:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我挑起的事端\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not the one who caused offense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.63,0:36:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,西利西亚人是过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Cilician overstepped, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.90,0:36:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你的反应也…\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet your response was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.98,0:36:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,理应如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was as it fucking should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.29,0:36:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是朱庇特敢动你 我也要让他悔青肠子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jupiter himself would find cause to tremble if he laid hand upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.38,0:36:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了我敢向神宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would battle a god for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.87,0:36:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would slay all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.69,0:36:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有敢将你从我怀中抢走的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would lay attempt to wrest you from my arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.80,0:36:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想什么朱庇特和西利西亚人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike Jupiter and the Cilician from mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.55,0:36:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你比起来 他们都一文不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have them of no concern to the one that holds my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.13,0:38:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一言不发就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left absent word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.68,0:38:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才有人打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.62,0:38:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄得很吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was very loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.78,0:38:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去料理那只跟屁虫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave to make shadow flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.06,0:38:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,撩拨欲火\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to bring desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.06,0:38:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.14,0:38:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.11,0:39:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上衣服出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather your robes and leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.22,0:39:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.03,0:40:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does not please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.79,0:40:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is but a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.50,0:40:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是喜欢成熟的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would have a woman tend to my needs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.98,0:40:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我跟斯巴达克斯走之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}in brief hours before I move with Spartacus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.44,0:40:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.70,0:40:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.85,0:40:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.97,0:41:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没给我说谢谢的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've not given opportunity towards gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.89,0:41:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I yet draw breath because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.28,0:41:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的主人是死在战场上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dominus fell to an act of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.17,0:41:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死在天赐的英雄手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fell to a hero sent by the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.81,0:41:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄连你名字都不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that does not even recall your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.91,0:41:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫希贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sibyl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.53,0:41:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,希贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sibyl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.76,0:41:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你亏欠我的 希贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you feel you owe debt Sibyl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.39,0:41:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一切都是拜你所赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.86,0:41:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,想还债\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then see it repaid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.38,0:41:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就离我 还有我这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}by staying far from my presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.12,0:41:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And men of my kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.89,0:41:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把我辛苦赚来的都收走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would claim all that I have earned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.63,0:41:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have stolen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.13,0:41:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻占这座城的时候 我不也和兄弟们并肩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I not stand with my brothers when city was taken, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.91,0:41:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你同生共死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}risking life beside you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.69,0:41:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在维苏威那些战斗中\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I did in shadow of Vesuvius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.92,0:41:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不都他妈的这么干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and every fucking battle since?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.27,0:41:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的人都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As all that follow cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.63,0:41:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不光你一个人在牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know that you do not stand alone in sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.36,0:41:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那铁匠呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of the blacksmith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.71,0:41:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给他的钱也收走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you seize coin given him as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.42,0:42:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令 不是闲聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mistake command for conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.24,0:42:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我去干正事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall to your purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.15,0:42:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱在你手里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carry the balance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.51,0:42:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.24,0:42:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Gannicus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.75,0:42:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他歪歪倒倒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He comes upon heel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.46,0:42:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没剩几分力气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is left of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.92,0:42:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,托图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.84,0:42:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,干正事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall to task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.47,0:42:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们定好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are committed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.85,0:42:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳西尔 守好城墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasir, take position upon wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.60,0:42:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would stand with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.73,0:42:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.18,0:42:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall return shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.92,0:42:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦城门在我们身后关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once gate closes behind us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.82,0:42:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我的话谁也不许开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}do not see it raised short of my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.40,0:42:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不走就撑不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terms of stroll worsen by passing moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.20,0:42:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心有人叛变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep watchful eye towards sign of betrayal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.24,0:42:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒想要他们试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray they make fucking attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.27,0:43:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是赫拉克里奥和他手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Heracleo and his men, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.77,0:43:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,背信弃义\N{\fnArial\fs30}prove short of honor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.11,0:43:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那便就地处决\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill them where they stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.05,0:43:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开城门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.46,0:43:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着像西利西亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cilicians, by the look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.01,0:43:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么在希留爱沙城外登陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they take landing outside Sinuessa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.28,0:43:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}To seek alliance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.17,0:43:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯敢跟他们打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus stands the fool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.66,0:43:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就真蠢到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he risks dealings with such as them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.57,0:43:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这帮毛贼就是臭味相投\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are thieves of equal nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.11,0:43:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们达成协议 那我父亲围城的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they come to terms it would prevent my father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.71,0:43:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可就要失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}from starving the rebels out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.50,0:43:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不会让这种事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing I will not have fall to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.26,0:43:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫姆缪斯 让你的人准备进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummius, prepare your men to advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.73,0:43:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.14,0:43:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听老子号令行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall to fucking command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.32,0:44:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,提比略 你父亲明确下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiberius, your father gave strict order{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.23,0:44:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许与斯巴达克斯正面交锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to engage Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.93,0:44:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲要的是能打仗的狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father desires a wolf of battle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.09,0:44:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是亦步亦趋的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a well-heeled dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.28,0:44:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我要用鲜血与死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this night I shall honor him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.72,0:44:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他争光\N{\fnArial\fs30}with blood and death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.10,0:44:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全没有掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are too exposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.03,0:44:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯他们离开城墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus and his men more so, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.52,0:44:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我们更无依无靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}beyond the walls of his city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.84,0:44:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们出了城门\N{\fnArial\fs30}They spill from gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.65,0:44:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我号令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upon my signal only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.92,0:44:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能为了一时疑心坏了大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would give no errant cause to doubt intention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.80,0:44:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳西尔 你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasir, what do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.15,0:45:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit and piss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.60,0:45:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,太远 天又太黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are too far in darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.14,0:45:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does she say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.05,0:45:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人…决斗的那人…跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman your man make fight gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.44,0:45:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌尔比安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulpianus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.48,0:45:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他的肥婆还有关押在一起的跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With fat wife and others chained with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.93,0:45:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须搜索全城\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must sweep the city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.88,0:45:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Remain here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.10,0:45:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能是声东击西 想让我们远离城门\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be distraction, to draw us from the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.77,0:45:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.70,0:45:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好站你的岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not tear eyes from purpose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.33,0:45:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.63,0:45:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好的价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}As agreed upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.29,0:45:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 不过这也…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, I mean no offense, yet ah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.59,0:45:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.89,0:46:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果真言而有信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand a man of your word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.95,0:46:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当今世道你这种人不多见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very rare thing, in such a world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.55,0:46:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,更稀罕的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rarer yet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.94,0:46:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,能与我匹敌的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}to greet my equal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.29,0:46:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡斯特斯 艾德赫伯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castus. Adherbal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.15,0:46:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把该给这些兄弟的东西都拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring our brothers what they are owed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.76,0:46:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连句告别的话都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take leave of the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.65,0:46:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent parting words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.67,0:46:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟需要告别的人说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've broken them to all that matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.88,0:46:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是跟西利西亚人的交易做成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If dealings with the Cilicians end as desired, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.59,0:46:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子就花钱买路 离你们远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will buy passage far from your fucking presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.37,0:46:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也为你的朋友们花这笔钱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you buy such for your friends as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.03,0:46:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.16,0:46:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where there are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.49,0:46:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! I do not know what you speak of!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.29,0:46:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是罗马人 你他妈的背叛了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I speak of Romans. And your fucking treachery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.99,0:47:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.98,0:47:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wish for blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.46,0:47:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.47,0:47:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起拴着锁链的面包师\N{\fnArial\fs30}And find greater challenge than that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.05,0:47:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没那么容易对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a simple crafter of bread in fucking chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.91,0:47:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.50,0:47:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一共就这点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}this stands the sum of your offerings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.22,0:47:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神操蛋 当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the gods, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.97,0:47:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是让你先看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mere sample for your approval.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.65,0:47:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的都在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The remainder lies aboard my ships, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.91,0:47:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多了 一艘小船运不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}too great a cargo to ferry by skiff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.66,0:47:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我收了钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that payment has been received, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.72,0:47:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以开船进港了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall sail into port{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.47,0:47:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not the arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.96,0:47:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉让你糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, if you fell to confusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.65,0:47:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck your apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.90,0:47:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.76,0:48:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are your thoughts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.10,0:48:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是蠢到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I stand the fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.41,0:48:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然跟没信义的人做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}For laying trust in a man absent honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.06,0:48:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是时候 让我们就此分道扬镳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then perhaps the time has come. For us to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.87,0:48:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever part ways…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.62,0:48:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中计了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are betrayed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.69,0:48:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.10,0:48:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,操蛋的海盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking pirates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.90,0:48:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.64,0:48:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.66,0:49:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫姆缪斯死哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck is Mummius?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.84,0:49:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.24,0:50:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你们这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have had my fill…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.58,0:50:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of men such as you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.06,0:51:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫姆缪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.86,0:51:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.89,0:51:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有军队过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.28,0:51:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.04,0:51:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.45,0:52:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾牌阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Testudo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.23,0:52:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.47,0:52:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.38,0:52:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的没警告过你老子射程远吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I not warn you of my fucking reach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.40,0:52:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,早警告过你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.71,0:53:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都别动 - 撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stand ground! - Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.53,0:53:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都他妈的给老子坚守阵地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand your fucking ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.37,0:53:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.96,0:53:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.04,0:53:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,托图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.35,0:53:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须撤兵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must retreat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.66,0:54:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我不能让你送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No… - I will not see you fall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.04,0:54:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快追\N{\fnArial\fs30}After them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.69,0:54:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.65,0:54:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上回城\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must return to the city! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.12,0:54:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.74,0:54:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在怎么看 斯巴达克斯大王\N{\fnArial\fs30}How stand your thoughts now, King Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.99,0:54:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钱拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.17,0:54:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,开船进港\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see your ships to port.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.26,0:54:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.87,0:54:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.61,0:54:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你死在外头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you gone from this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.13,0:54:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会那么轻易就离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not so easily see me from your arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.05,0:54:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想去支援你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I attempted to come to your aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.69,0:55:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳美特斯人和他那群混蛋不给我开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemetes and his shits would not open gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.56,0:55:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果城门被攻破 死的人就更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}If gate had been breached, more would have fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.75,0:55:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不过是遵令行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He but followed command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.45,0:55:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白为什么罗马派个臭小子带这么点人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confounds why the Romans attacked in such small numbers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.03,0:55:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就来攻打我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}led by a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.18,0:55:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没道理啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It holds no sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.10,0:55:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人身上能找到答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer lay among the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.62,0:55:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认敌为友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those we mistakenly name friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.70,0:55:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他先动手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came at me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.45,0:55:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问他为什么要帮乌尔比安\N{\fnArial\fs30}when confronted with question of aiding Ulpianus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.91,0:55:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他在逃的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the others in escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.91,0:55:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were left absent choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.11,0:55:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他出手帮助我们夺城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would he lend hand in taking city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.65,0:55:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了拿性命开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to risk life in such attempt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.63,0:55:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是想把低贱的泥土 塑造成有价值的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He but sought to form basest clay, into something of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.66,0:56:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有比这更重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There stands matters of more pressing concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.39,0:56:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索全城 找到乌尔比安和其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us sweep city for Ulpianus and the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.85,0:56:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让罗马人密谋添乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have Romans plotting beneath foot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.60,0:56:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成更大的损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}or seeking greater harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.73,0:56:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.25,0:56:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more over here.{\r}
